{"id":"2114266cad","t":"Taming Of Heroes","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/20250430_055510-193x278.jpg","n":50,"l":50,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes"},"u":1795038105013,"desc":"لكي تتمكن من تربية ابنتها، تحتاج الأميرة الشريرة إلى الولاء من الأبطال!. حُكم على “الأميرة المتعطشة للدماء” مارتينا بالنفي في حياتها السابقة، و تم تسميم “ابنتها” حتى الموت . لقد بذلت كل ما لديها للحصول على فرصة جديدة. في هذه الحياة، من أجل حماية ابنتها، يجب على مارتينا ترويض الأبطال و الحصول على ولائهم ! ما الأحداث القادمة و ما هي خطة أميرتنا لحماية إبنتها؟!!","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["إنتقام","رعاية اطفال","رومانسى","فانتازيا"],"src":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/1/"},"2":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/2/"},"3":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/3/"},"4":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/4/"},"5":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/5/"},"6":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/6/"},"7":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/7/"},"8":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/8/"},"9":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/9/"},"10":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/10/"},"11":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/11/"},"12":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/12/"},"13":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/13/"},"14":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/14/"},"15":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/15/"},"16":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/16/"},"17":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/17/"},"18":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/18/"},"19":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/19/"},"20":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/20/"},"21":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/21/"},"22":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/taming-of-heroes/22/"},"23":{"ml":"taming-of-heroes|/manga/ta